            <div xml:id="d114-a1">

                <pb facs="0297" n="169" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg169"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 4.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Decree published in the manuscript Peking Gazette of
                        date the 13th of April</hi>, 1885.</head>
                <p>A decree issued in the presence of the ministers of the Grand Council. As France
                    and China have now under consideration the question for the arrangement of
                    peace, it being agreed upon the execution of the Tien-Tsin teaty, we command
                    that the garrisons at all places (<hi rendition="#italic">lit.</hi>, all roads)
                    at the fixed period cease fighting. We further command that all the garrisons of
                    the Yaman and Kwangsi, in accordance with the terms of the convention, at the
                    fixed period be withdrawn from the frontier.</p>
                <p>Respect this.</p>
            </div>
